Hello {name},
your life sign on myLife is due. One click is enough, no sign-in needed: {link}
You can also simply sign in to myLife. If you do not respond, myLife will remind you {count} more times. Only after that and a waiting period will your trusted persons get access, on {date} at the earliest.

Hello {name},
we have not had a life sign from you yet. One click is enough: {link}
Without a response, your trusted persons will get access to what you shared with them on {date} at the earliest.

Hello {name},

something is due on myLife:
{items}

Sign in; the overview shows what it is about:
{link}

This email deliberately contains no details. You can adjust reminders under "Reminders" after signing in.
